ork Upgrades and Interconnection Facilities', Proposed, A in MTEP26, $70.5M, est. ISD Dec-29; MISO's ERAS request list (seen only as a search excerpt) gives E0012 as a 1,186 MW Invenergy gas plant in Kenosha County with POI 'Paris-Lakeview 345kV double circuit'. That this is a new station is inferred from the line-tap POI, not stated outright.</value></Data><Data name="builder"><value>American Transmission Co.</value></Data><Data name="from_status"><value>unconfirmed</value></Data><Data name="from_there_now"><value>unknown</value></Data><Data name="from_work"><value>new line or substation work planned</value></Data><Data name="from_work_stage"><value>proposed</value></Data><Data name="to_status"><value>unconfirmed</value></Data><Data name="to_there_now"><value>unknown</value></Data><Data name="to_work"><value>new line or substation work planned</value></Data><Data name="to_work_stage"><value>proposed</value></Data><Data name="location_quality"><value>county</value></Data><Data name="queue_projects"><value>0</value></Data><Data name="queue_mw"><value>0</value></Data><Data name="geometry_note"><value>Straight line between the end substations, not the route</value></Data></ExtendedData><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-88.0423,42.576,0 -88.0423,42.576,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>Edmund 345 kV switching station (cut-in of Cardinal - Hickory Creek 345 kV, J1773 interconnection)</name><styleUrl>#proposed</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="feature_type"><value>line</value></Data><Data name="id"><value>misor-wi-edmund-345-swst</value></Data><Data name="name"><value>Edmund 345 kV switching station (cut-in of Cardinal - Hickory Creek 345 kV, J1773 interconnection)</value></Data><Data name="kv"><value>345</value></Data><Data name="in_service"><value>2029-05</value></Data><Data name="in_service_kind"><value>projected</value></Data><Data name="project_type"><value>new substation</value></Data><Data name="miles_new"><value>0</value>